  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reg.Off. for global educ. - Anna Mogren</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Reg.ansv. undervisn. int</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida anlitar 12 konsulter, sk regionansvariga f&#xf6;r undervisningens internationalisering, som verkar f&#xf6;r att &#xf6;ka intresset f&#xf6;r och kunskapen om globala fr&#xe5;gor hos ungdomar och st&#xf6;dja och stimulera l&#xe4;rare med arbetet kring dessa fr&#xe5;gor i undervisningen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida engage 12 regional advisors (consultants) for education for development. The objective is to develop young people&apos;s intrest in and knowledge of circumstances of importance for the developing countries. They also support to teachers in their work with  development issues.</narrative>
  </description>
